    "summary": "- Every invoice has a `number` (\"INV-000001\", ...) assigned at creation from a per-organization sequence, and every invoice API answer shows it. Snapshot v3 stores the numbers and each organization's next number; v1 and v2 files get numbers in creation order.\n- Save writes version 3 atomically (temp file in the same folder, then rename). `snapshot.Upgrade(path)` backs up older files to `\u003cpath\u003e.v\u003cold\u003e.bak` and leaves version 3 alone. Versions above 3 fail with `ErrUnsupportedVersion` in both Load and Upgrade.\n- Tests cover numbering, the v2 to v3 migration, atomic save leaving no temp file, Upg\n...[truncated]",
